          "quote": "NAVC2 STM32F405RGTx: pins 31 and 47 are labeled VCAP_1 and VCAP_2, NET0066 and NET0043; no capacitors are drawn on those nets. Sheet Navigation Computer, page 3."
        },
        {
          "source": "schematic",
          "quote": "UART3_FCC2 connector pins 3 and 4 are labeled NET0005 and NET0089. Sheet FCC Peripherals, page 5."
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "The FCC is populated with an STM32H753VITx ... and the NAVC with an STM32F405RGTx."
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The STM32 internal core regulators may be unstable or fail to start, preventing reliable MCU operation. Connecting an FCC VCAP rail to connector signals can additionally load or disturb the core supply.",
      "confidence": 0.97
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The schematic omits the required VCAP capacitors for both STM32 MCUs. The FCC VCAP nets also share labels with UART connector signals, creating an additional risk to core-supply operation."
}

